-9b5c-5cc92b49bdf7" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $A$ given below.\nWhich entries of $A$ could be replaced by $0$ in order to get a matrix in row echelon form?\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$"] ["question-0e1c37ba-9f8b-5e26-9b5c-5cc92b49bdf7" :question/worked-solution "Notice that by replacing ${a}_{21}$ and ${a}_{34}$ with $0$, we get a matrix in row echelon form:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\,⟶\\,[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThe other options will not give us a matrix in row echelon form."] ["question-0e1c37ba-9f8b-5e26-9b5c-5cc92b49bdf7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-f0a08139-05fb-537f-90de-7085394dbc8b" :answer-field/id #uuid "f0a08139-05fb-537f-90de-7085394dbc8b"] ["answer-47f0aad3-1a10-51ec-97ad-c2502e1ac702" :answer/id #uuid "47f0aad3-1a10-51ec-97ad-c2502e1ac702"] ["answer-47f0aad3-1a10-51ec-97ad-c2502e1ac702" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-47f0aad3-1a10-51ec-97ad-c2502e1ac702" :answer/value "${a}_{21}$ and ${a}_{24}$ only"] ["answer-b1fd454d-4bb9-5838-801d-3fbe5817e9db" :answer/id #uuid "b1fd454d-4bb9-5838-801d-3fbe5817e9db"] ["answer-b1fd454d-4bb9-5838-801d-3fbe5817e9db" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-b1fd454d-4bb9-5838-801d-3fbe5817e9db" :answer/value "${a}_{21}$ and ${a}_{34}$ only"] ["answer-0689e81c-0224-5f6b-a257-4a6bbd06afc1" :answer/id #uuid "0689e81c-0224-5f6b-a257-4a6bbd06afc1"] ["answer-0689e81c-0224-5f6b-a257-4a6bbd06afc1" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-0689e81c-0224-5f6b-a257-4a6bbd06afc1" :answer/value "${a}_{21}$ only"] ["answer-2b860153-ee73-5558-a157-5767b1512df5" :answer/id #uuid "2b860153-ee73-5558-a157-5767b1512df5"] ["answer-2b860153-ee73-5558-a157-5767b1512df5" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-2b860153-ee7